{
  "id": "volunteer-day",
  "title": "參加志工活動",
  "titleEn": "Volunteer Day in the Community",
  "category": "城市與公共服務",
  "level": "進階",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/volunteer-day.webp",
    "alt": "週六早晨的陽光灑在社區步道上，幾位高中生志工戴著手套、拿著夾子與回收袋，並肩協作清理垃圾並分類寶特瓶，展現充滿活力的團隊合作精神。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "On Saturday morning, high school students gather in the park to "
        },
        {
          "text": "volunteer",
          "wordIds": [
            "volunteer"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for their local "
        },
        {
          "text": "community",
          "wordIds": [
            "community"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "週六早晨，高中生們在公園集合，為當地的社區擔任志工。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/volunteer-day/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "2d9a3aa1f84c77a2caf8105770c30a72f814b664de6173a03734425a00a7e64b",
        "sha256": "b9bb0bd75ece6d39449549f9e398ecca6da559a3aa2e163ebadf6a75c166db8f"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Meeting the organizer, Leo waves with a warm smile and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "We are glad to be here.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-are-glad-to-be-here"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "見到主辦人時，Leo 帶著溫暖的微笑揮手並說：「我們很高興能來到這裡。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/volunteer-day/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "a76d21b5eff8a17fee30ed083f21ac93caba894413ed0f217a2e0571c50f8fe2",
        "sha256": "9ab84acbbd007f88c1d1d80b8406fa31fe0253f68d09d7934ddbdef0d0849d67"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He puts on sturdy work gloves and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "How can I help?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "how-can-i-help"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他戴上結實的工作手套並詢問：「我該如何幫忙？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/volunteer-day/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "f828844df1bf160cb7c86bebd3a509ecafcec9b1be06e8b77a0ba0bec17e5c79",
        "sha256": "6b0a376aae9a22dbf198b6267d282b54324eb940101a89b9a521ccd188577a47"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo teams up with a "
        },
        {
          "text": "partner",
          "wordIds": [
            "partner"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-collect-the-bottles"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "collect",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-collect-the-bottles"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "collect"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the bottles.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-collect-the-bottles"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 與一位夥伴組隊，並說：「我們來收集瓶子吧。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/volunteer-day/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "57a55fc36b94e200fa5f10578181967657b55c499054f0730576f86c562c2752",
        "sha256": "acbd84156647b81d9c167dc2247a5a64188c16db34ec688689d75feb567ee645"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They pick up discarded trash along the paths to "
        },
        {
          "text": "recycle",
          "wordIds": [
            "recycle"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " plastic containers properly."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們沿著步道撿起被丟棄的垃圾，妥善回收塑膠容器。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/volunteer-day/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "62635d06e5f8d458a1d2462cd9db18cf894dcc4ff7832c5111a5d9b2dea0fe5a",
        "sha256": "53e2be7108da70c3fde197802ea37f9cbe46fa22cfa33d50acd5ca8ef07de95c"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Looking at the tidy walkways, the coordinator shouts, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Great teamwork everyone!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "great-teamwork-everyone"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "看著整潔的步道，協調員高喊：「大家團隊合作太棒了！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/volunteer-day/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "7befc7067e91b0af21c8bfcf6a4fa09a35e534867668629093baf53d1dc7ee5a",
        "sha256": "4306601502cfd13550ae41cde27d5519c6ceab10f64a4fc29bda5d4e6e9f5ee7"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Walking home with new friends, Leo feels "
        },
        {
          "text": "proud",
          "wordIds": [
            "proud"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of making his neighborhood a better place."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "與新朋友們一起走回家時，Leo 為讓自己的社區變得更美好而感到驕傲。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/volunteer-day/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "2192725cc4b42d151e3d9d989d7c2c38241abac414f14f2a00ca2b68f215d6f0",
        "sha256": "893edcccb7a1ef43a35264930b1b0bc85692eccd7e61d3b6baca30057b74fbb5"
      }
    }
  ],
